	(text "3 in parallel = 0.303333R: lowest limit 2.90 A delivers 103 W (>= 110 % of 75 W) at every input; highest 3.91 A with the line feed-forward (4.27 A without)\nline feed-forward HV_BULK -> CS (CRHV2512): CS offset 101 mV at 1000 V cancels most of the 155-250 ns CS-delay overshoot, so the highest current limit no longer rises with the input\nClamp: BYG10Y + 6 x SMCJ33A; V_DS 1316 / 1420 V at 1000 / 1100 V."
